  "details": "Since some of the most prolific creators of some of the most beautiful worlds have already asked for the things we need to remove the worst elements from our worlds way back.. waaaaayy back. \n\nI won't rehash it here. Lucifer M had it right. and here we are in 2023 and still... still with all the horrors we see, those reasonable tools to help secure our worlds and protect some of the most vulnerable communities are not here, not in our hands.  \n\nIs this a rant.. No.  What it is, is a statement that I had no idea that so many were begging, cajoling and people willing to build an alter to the ones that could give them the simplest tools to be rid of the absolute vermin. \n\nAnd they had been begging it, For so damn long .. I think how much suffering could have been saved in all this time.   \n\nAnd we wait, for another \"update\" ...",
